			"notes": "v1.1.0\n\n- Added support for [Iron's Arms 'n Artifice](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-artifice) on NeoForge 1.21.1.\n- Added support for [Timeless and Classics Zero UNOFFICIAL PORT](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-1-21-1) on NeoForge 1.21.1.\n\t- NOTE: This is the unofficial version of Timeless and Classics Zero. I have previously stated that I won't support unofficial mods but this port seems to be accepted by the original devs to some extent so I decided to go for it until we hopefully get a 1.21.1 version for the official TaCZ.\n- Updated Vic's Point Blank support to the newest version.\n\t- Dual wielded (akimbo) weapons are now usable. Both weapons will be fired alternately.\n\t- NOTE: Fabric 1.20.1 version of Vic's Point Blank have not been updated as of writing this. This feature is not implemented in that version.\n- (finally) Added left mouse button click to initiate shooting phase. Manual marking option still exists in the keybinds menu (G by default).\n- Added a Dead Eye Sound Volume config option. It controls all of the Dead Eye sounds' volume. With this change, \"Players\" sound volume setting does not affect Dead Eye sounds anymore.\n- Shooting camera movement speed now takes the target's speed into account.\n- Adjusted pitches of some sounds slightly.\n- Fixed a bug that let players mark targets through blocks. Now only glass and any non-solid blocks are allowed.\n- Lots of small bug fixes and improvements."
		},
